1. OWNERSHIP

This software and its accompanying materials are the proprietary property of
The Letter Loom and are protected by copyright law and international treaties.
They include, without limitation:

  (a) the source code, in every form and language;
  (b) the artwork, the character illustrations and their biographies, the card
      designs, the icons and the visual identity;
  (c) the interface text, the help and rules text, and the wording in which the
      rules of play are expressed;
  (d) the curated word lists and the data files derived from them;
  (e) the particular selection, arrangement and presentation of the game's
      mechanics — the specific combination of cards, values, letter
      distributions, scoring steps, multipliers, penalties and phases, and the
      manner in which they are expressed and presented to a player.


