without the prior written consent of the copyright holder.

This reservation applies however the reproduction is carried out, and the
holder draws no distinction between the means employed. It extends in
particular to reproduction, adaptation or derivation:

  (a) by a person working manually, whether by transcription, by
      re-implementation from observation of the software in use, or otherwise;
  (b) by automated means of any kind, including scraping, crawling, decompiling
      and the automated extraction of assets or data; and
  (c) by or with the assistance of artificial intelligence systems, including
      the use of any part of the foregoing as training data, as input to a
      generative model, or as the basis on which such a model produces a
      substantially similar work.

For the avoidance of doubt, an output that reproduces protected expression is
an infringement whether a human or a machine produced it, and the involvement
of an automated system neither creates a new right in the result nor
extinguishes the rights reserved here.


3. TEXT AND DATA MINING

The rightholder expressly reserves the right of reproduction and extraction
